        <div class="project-meta"><span>2024</span><span>Quarto · R</span></div>
        <a class="project-title" href="https://github.com/kalonji08/BigBookofR-Quarto.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BigBookofR — Quarto Edition</a>
        <p class="project-desc">A Quarto-powered interactive reference site compiling the Big Book of R — a curated collection of free R programming resources for data science and statistics.</p>
